    - the next major task for the argument is to infer a practical principle of pure logic
      that arguably (as I shall argue later) is enforced and thereby absolute
        : cf. `^*\+ argue for.+a stable ground of maintenance re practical logic$`
    + state the premises that directly support that inference
        (-) the only plausible explanation for the coincidence is a practical logic that itself
          {director of directors} directs each director to[ward] [the end|object of] self-maintenance
            (-) multiple [outwardly independent] mechanisms/processes of end|object direction
              (directors) coincide in their direction, in that each directs to an end|object
              that entails the maintainence of the director itself
                (-) reason {that mechanism/process}
                  through the logic of default grounding
                  directs the populations wherein reason itself subsists
                  to (an end|object that entails) their own maintainence
                (-) natural selection {that mechanism/process}
                  through a logic of …
                  directs the populations wherein natural selection itself subsists
                  to maintain themselves
                (-) …  {that mechanism/process}
                  through a logic of {existential hazard}|extancy|extinction}
                  directs … {the directors wherein it subsists?}
                  to … {maintain themselves?}
                    - no mechanism/process this, rather the very ‘practical logic that itself {director
                      of directors} directs each director to[ward] [the end|object of] self-maintenance’
                        : re `‘(.+)’`s see `^*\(-\) the.+explanation.+is a ${same}$`p
                        - the ontological|existential necessity of [self-maintenance by]
                          on-going existential-hazard reduction
                            : see notepad:2026-10-5a
                            - a predicament for all things that face existential hazard
                                = axiom + fact of existential hazard
                            - not explicitly a logic
                                - rather the logic emerges as the sole possibility
                                  on seeking an explanation for the predicament
                                    : see notepad:2026-10-5a,b
                      \ | a logic that directs each end|object director to[ward] [an end|object of]
                      \   [self-maintenance by] existential-hazard reduction
                    - this logic is a (further) direct premise of the principle,
                      moreover the main premise
                        + so make it
                        + restructure the other premises accordingly
                    ?+ how then formulate the principle?
                        L = [material] operative instance of practical logic
                            - as simple as possible
                        - trying to subject L to the predicament, further premises:
                            (-) all L are prone to existential hazard
                            (-) no L perdures|{tends to persist|endure} except by self-maintenance
                        !! tension between individual and collective L
                            | no L perdures except as an LL, an L that subsists as
